{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233380","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233380","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423338001:1":{"text":"자, 이제 모두 찾았네요. 숨바꼭질도 무사히 끝났어요. 이제 다 같이 집에 가요!","source_cn":"好啦，这下所有的人都被找到了，捉迷藏游戏顺利完成！大家...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x565C71421934B329","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423338002:1":{"text":"집이요? 싫어요! 아직 더 놀고 싶은데요!","source_cn":"回家？不！我们还没玩够呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x023AF12C80DAFC90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423338003:1":{"text":"제이미, 어른을 불러오는 건 반칙이야! 이 겁쟁이!","source_cn":"詹米找大人来当外援，詹米犯规！詹米是胆小鬼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6E2397FA6706CD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423338004:1":{"text":"찾으면 집에 간다고 약속 안 했거든요! 그건 제이미 혼자서 한 약속이잖아요. 그러니까 저흰 계속 놀 거예요. 계속, 계속!","source_cn":"我可没有答应被找到之后要回家，一定是詹米答应的！我们还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F2C3B0F170BD7B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423338005:1":{"text":"방금 팬텀 포자 버섯에게 잡힐 뻔했으면서 아직도 여기서 놀고 싶은 거예요?","source_cn":"你刚刚都差点被幻灵孢菇攻击了，还要待在这里吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x317738B6C9C052AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423338006:1":{"text":"그건 실수였잖아요! 다음번에는 그렇게 외진 곳에 안 숨으면 되구...","source_cn":"那只是个意外！大不了我下次藏在不那么偏僻的地方嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0F89818F8D78CD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423338007:1":{"text":"여러분도 이제 어린이는 아니잖아요. 물론 마음껏 놀아도 되지만, 때와 장소를 가리지 않고 장난치는 건 안 돼요...","source_cn":"你们这么大的年纪，虽然可以尽情享受游戏的乐趣，但也不能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFABE9BD1E0CF2AEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423338008:1":{"text":"가끔은 차분히 앉아서 책도 보고, 뭔가 배우기도 해야죠...","source_cn":"也该抽时间安静下来，读一些书，学点东西……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE698E2127D601B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1423338009:1":{"text":"무슨 말인지 하나도 못 알아듣겠는데요!","source_cn":"她说的是什么意思啊？我听不懂！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC25FDA5292070ABA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1423338010:1":{"text":"어쨌든 저희가 성공하는 길은 귀족의 하인이 되는 것뿐이잖아요. 그런 거 배워서 뭐에 써요?","source_cn":"反正我们长大后最好的出路不过是去当贵族的仆从，学你说的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9B5C0B76D3087A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1423338011:1":{"text":"하인이요? 하지만 왕성은 이미...","source_cn":"仆从？可是现在王城已经……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82DDA96A4F03BA0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1423338012:1":{"text":"어쨌든 제이미는 있는 집 애라고요. 제이미나 데리고 가세요. 우린 여기서 더 놀 테니까 신경쓰지 말라고요!","source_cn":"总之，詹米是有家的孩子，詹米回家就好，我们更愿意待在这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76AB89BE55B7DA27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱妮":{"text":"라이니","source":"莱妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:希娜":{"text":"시나","source":"希娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:朱尔":{"text":"주르","source":"朱尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":5}}